                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14246950" author="rdblue" created="Mon, 15 Dec 2014 18:18:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;One work-around is to use &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-107&quot; title=&quot;Add option to disable summary metadata aggregation after MR jobs&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-107&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-107&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, which disables the summary metadata files if you set parquet.enable.summary-metadata to false. This wasn&apos;t in 1.5.0, so you&apos;ll have to backport it, use an unreleased RC version (not recommended), or find out if your Hadoop distribution has included it in their version of Parquet.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14567059" author="saucam" created="Mon, 1 Jun 2015 08:19:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/205&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/205&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14568089" author="rdblue" created="Mon, 1 Jun 2015 21:49:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merge &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=saucam&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;saucam&quot;&gt;saucam&lt;/a&gt;&apos;s patch. Thanks for the contribution!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857114" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1705&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1705&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
